{"title":"牧羊人","url":"https://www.shephe.com/","favicon":"https://www.shephe.com/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"✨ 赶上潮流！部署开源网盘聚合工具 OpenList","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/deploy-openlist-aggregate-cloud-storage/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">✨ 赶上潮流！部署开源网盘聚合工具 OpenList</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/data-backup.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/data-backup-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-10-04T23:20:56+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t10/04/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>✨ 赶上潮流！部署开源网盘聚合工具 OpenList</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>妈的，刚把百度云调试好，稳定运行两个月了。本想着这台 36/年的年抛机能用个一年，等明年再换个更好的，但谁能想到，百度云备案核查中心三天两头打电话找茬。刚开始是“没有悬挂备案号”，然后又说备案号没有指向工信部的链接……结果今天又被说，站名“…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/deploy-openlist-aggregate-cloud-storage/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/deploy-openlist-aggregate-cloud-storage/","retrieved":1759643156867},{"title":"利用用 3D Lut Creator 插件给图片调色，颜色滤镜","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/3d-lut-creator/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">利用用 3D Lut Creator 插件给图片调色，颜色滤镜</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/shephe.com_09-24_15-13.webp 1600w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/shephe.com_09-24_15-13-768x395.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-24T16:17:34+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/24/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>利用用 3D Lut Creator 插件给图片调色，颜色滤镜</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在摄影后期中，调色往往决定了一张作品的最终氛围和表现力。即便是同一张照片，通过不同的色彩处理，也能传递完全不同的情绪：清新的绿色让人联想到自然与活力，温暖的橙色能营造出舒适与怀旧的气息，而冷调的蓝色则容易带来理性与沉静的感觉。调色不仅仅是修…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/3d-lut-creator/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/resources/3d-lut-creator/","retrieved":1759211255764},{"title":"Photoshop 老插件提示“未经正确签署”的解决办法","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/photoshop-unsigned-extensions-reg-fix/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Photoshop 老插件提示“未经正确签署”的解决办法</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Photoshop-banner.jpg 1400w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Photoshop-banner-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Photoshop-banner-1390x782.jpg 1390w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-19T08:31:11+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/19/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Photoshop 老插件提示“未经正确签署”的解决办法</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在使用 Photoshop 的过程中，我们经常会遇到一个问题：一些老旧插件或者扩展在新版 Photoshop 中无法安装，提示“未经正确签署”。这是因为 Adobe 从 CC 2019 开始逐步强化了安全策略，要求所有扩展必须通过签署才能被…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/photoshop-unsigned-extensions-reg-fix/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/photoshop-unsigned-extensions-reg-fix/","retrieved":1759211255764},{"title":"一次首页攻击的应对：宝塔 WAF 精准拦截实录","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/traffic-attack-protection-experience/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">一次首页攻击的应对：宝塔 WAF 精准拦截实录</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-backgroun