om-blue-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-10T12:00:57+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/10/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Lightroom Classic 重磅更新：一键智能移除照片中的干扰人物</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在日常拍摄中，我们常常遇到这样的问题：好不容易捕捉到完美的构图，却总有“路人甲”闯入画面，破坏了整体氛围。过去，我们可能需要借助复杂的修图技巧才能抹掉这些背景人物。而现在，Lightroom Classic 带来了一项全新 AI 功能——「…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/lightroom-classic-distraction-removal-people/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/lightroom-classic-distraction-removal-people/","retrieved":1759211255770},{"title":"Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/website-seo-optimize-title-and-description-tags.svg\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-08T23:52:09+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/08/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Adobe 近几年在生成式 AI 上投入巨大，尤其是 Firefly 图像生成以及 Photoshop 的生成式填充功能，让很多用户体验到了 AI 在创作中的便利。但在使用时，不少人会遇到一个新概念——生成式积分。很多人一开始并不清楚，这个…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/","retrieved":1759211255771},{"title":"飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑.webp 1067w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑-512x768.webp 512w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-08T09:05:21+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/08/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>七夕上午，我一边忙着工作的事儿一边在收拾家里，准备第二天会老家给奶奶过生日，同时看看已有一月未见的果果，可不曾想接到妈妈的电话，她略带哭腔的说：你爸爸被车撞了...！ 我第一反应是追问人伤得怎么样，听到“暂时没有生命危险”才稍微松了一口气。…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/","retrieved":1759686368452},{"title":"仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/tea-cat-studio1.webp 1067w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/tea-cat-studio1-512x768.webp 512w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-29T09:45:54+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/29/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在婚礼摄影中，调色的风格往往决定了作品的气质与灵魂。近年来，“钟祖兵风格”成为许多摄影师和新人喜欢的风格。这种以暗调电影感为核心的审美突破了传统明亮、饱和的婚礼影像，营造出如同电影场景般的氛围感，让婚礼影像不再只是记录，而是具有温度与情绪的…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/","retrieved":1759859079051},{"title":"Goodbye, Memos","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Goodbye, Memos</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39.webp 1600w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-1390x782.webp 1390w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-28T11:19:10+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/28/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Goodbye, Memos</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>我翻了翻自己在 Memos 上的第一条动态，是在 2024 年年中发的。那时候应该是看了五木大神的帖子「</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38